<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<icon_design>
    <app_name>gambarmijon</app_name>
    <colors>
        <color_start>#0f172a</color_start>
        <color_end>#1e293b</color_end>
    </colors>
    <background_style>
        <ornament>ios17_fluid_wave</ornament>
    </background_style>
    <proportions>
        <icon_scale>0.85</icon_scale>
    </proportions>
    <svg_elements>
        <!-- Layer 1: Atmosphere Base (Dark Obsidian Base) -->
        <rect x="20" y="20" width="60" height="60" rx="14" fill="url(#glossy-dark)" filter="url(#drop-shadow-sm)"/>
        
        <!-- Layer 2: Core Silhouette (The Aperture / Eye) -->
        <!-- Outer Golden Ring -->
        <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="22" fill="#f59e0b" filter="url(#inner-shadow)"/>
        <!-- Inner Deep Blue Lens -->
        <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="16" fill="#1d4ed8" filter="url(#inner-shadow)"/>
        <!-- Aperture Blades (Abstract representation using paths) -->
        <path d="M50 34 C 55 40, 60 45, 66 50 C 60 55, 55 60, 50 66 C 45 60, 40 55, 34 50 C 40 45, 45 40, 50 34 Z" fill="#0ea5e9" opacity="0.8" filter="url(#inner-shadow)"/>

        <!-- Layer 3: Inner Mechanics (The Amazon 'Smile' / Parameter curve) -->
        <path d="M 38 56 Q 50 64 62 56" stroke="none" fill="none" /> <!-- Used as reference, no stroke allowed -->
        <!-- Solid representation of the curve -->
        <path d="M 36 55 Q 50 66 64 55 Q 62 58 50 68 Q 38 58 36 55 Z" fill="#f59e0b" filter="url(#drop-shadow-sm)"/>
        <!-- Small arrow head -->
        <polygon points="62,54 68,56 64,60" fill="#f59e0b" />

        <!-- Layer 4: Overlays & Refraction (Liquid Glass Dome) -->
        <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="22" class="frosted-glass" opacity="0.3"/>
        <path d="M28 50 A 22 22 0 0 1 72 50 Z" fill="url(#glossy-white)" opacity="0.15"/>

        <!-- Layer 5: Micro-Highlights & Lighting -->
        <!-- Main Specular Highlight on Lens -->
        <ellipse cx="42" cy="40" rx="4" ry="2" fill="#ffffff" opacity="0.6" transform="rotate(-30 42 40)"/>
        <!-- Micro LED indicators for parameters -->
        <circle cx="28" cy="28" r="1.5" fill="#10b981" opacity="0.9" filter="url(#drop-shadow-sm)"/>
        <circle cx="72" cy="28" r="1.5" fill="#ef4444" opacity="0.9" filter="url(#drop-shadow-sm)"/>
    </svg_elements>
    <visual_prompt>Desain ikon ini menggunakan metafora "Lensa Mata Observasi" untuk mencerminkan fungsi ekstraksi dan analisis gambar. Basis terbuat dari material Onyx gelap dengan refraksi halus. Inti lensa memadukan warna Emas (ciri khas e-commerce) dan Biru Safir yang melambangkan presisi teknis URL. Geometri internal menggunakan kurva bezir untuk memahat bentuk menyerupai senyuman/panah ikonik, diukir padat tanpa garis. Seluruh elemen dibungkus lapisan kaca cair (frosted-glass) dengan pantulan cahaya asimetris di sudut kiri atas untuk dimensi ekstra.</visual_prompt>
</icon_design>
